"notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/43fadd248456e3a9caa6.m4a", "recited": "audio/e3a5e57314c32ef11429.m4a", "recitedText": "وَٱشْهَدْ"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "اِشْهَدِي", "plain": "اِشْهَدِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/99e1e8a5679e049b5974.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اِشْهَدَا", "plain": "اِشْهَدَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/d25373e79896821174de.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "ٱشْهَدُوا۟", "plain": "اِشْهَدُوا", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/46d5bf7f882468c547a0.m4a", "recited": "audio/a81bf440ca551b8a8fb3.m4a", "recitedText": "ٱشْهَدُوا۟"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اِشْهَدْنَ", "plain": "اِشْهَدْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/946fd6a72aa65614f0c2.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "41:20", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4238.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Till, when they reach it, their ears and their eyes and their skins testify against them as to what they used to do.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Nihayet oraya vardıkları zaman kulakları, gözleri ve derileri yaptıkları şeyler hakkında onların aleyhinde şahitlik ederler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "یہاں تک کہ پچھلے آ ملیں یہاں تک کہ جب وہاں پہنچیں گے ان کے کان اور ان کی آنکھیں اور ان کے چمڑے سب ان پر ان کے کیے کی گواہی دیں گے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sehingga apabila mereka sampai ke neraka, pendengaran, penglihatan dan kulit mereka menjadi saksi terhadap mereka tentang apa yang telah mereka kerjakan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "حَتَّىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَآءُوهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَهِدَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/49e98d5fca9403165db9.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "svjedočit će", "en": "will testify", "tr": "şahitlik edecek", "fr": "témoignera", "id": "akan bersaksi", "ur": "وہ گواہی دے گا", "bn": "সাক্ষ্য দেবে", "fa": "گواهی خواهد داد"}}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَمْعُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَبْصَٰرُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَجُلُودُهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْمَلُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "43:19", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4344.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And they make the angels, who are the slaves of the Beneficent, females. Did they witness their creation? Their testimony will be recorded and they will be questioned.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar Rahman olan Allah'ın kulları olan melekleri de dişi saydılar. Onlar meleklerin yaratılışını gördüler mi? Onların şahitlikleri yazılacak ve onlar sorguya çekileceklerdir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور انہوں نے فرشتوں کو، کہ رحمٰن کے بندے ہیں عورتیں ٹھہرایا کیا ان کے بناتے وقت یہ حاضر تھے اب لکھ لی جائے گی ان کی گواہی اور ان سے جواب طلب ہوگا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan mereka menjadikan malaikat-malaikat yang mereka itu adalah hamba-hamba Allah Yang Maha Pemurah sebagai orang-orang perempuan. Apakah mereka menyaksikan penciptaan malaika-malaikat itu? Kelak akan dituliskan persaksian mereka dan mereka akan dimintai pertanggung-jawaban.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَجَعَلُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عِبَٰدُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَٰثًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَشَهِدُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/680130fd7519421ec1be.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "did they witness?", "bs": "zar su prisustvovali?", "tr": "hazır bulundular mı?", "fr": "ont-ils assisté ?", "id": "apakah mereka menyaksikan?", "ur": "کیا انہوں نے گواہی دی؟", "bn": "তারা কি উপস্থিত ছিল?", "fa": "آیا گواهی دادند؟"}}, {"text": "خَلْقَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَتُكْتَبُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَهَٰدَتُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيُسْـَٔلُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "21:61", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2544.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "They said: Then bring him (hither) before the people's eyes that they may testify.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"O halde onu insanların gözleri önüne getirin, olur ki (aleyhinde) şahidlik ederler\" dediler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بولے تو اسے لوگوں کے سامنے لاؤ شاید وہ گواہی دیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka berkata: \"(Kalau demikian) bawalah dia dengan cara yang dapat dilihat orang banyak, agar mereka menyaksikan\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأْتُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَعْيُنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَعَلَّهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَشْهَدُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d6ff1f6475242f238fe0.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they witness", "bs": "svjedoče", "tr": "şahitlik ederler", "fr": "ils témoignent", "id": "mereka bersaksi", "ur": "وہ گواہی دیتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা সাক্ষ্য দেয়", "fa": "گواهی می‌دهند"}}]}, {"ref": "3:70", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/363.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "O People of the Scripture! Why disbelieve ye in the revelations of Allah, when ye (yourselves) bear witness (to their truth)?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ey kitap ehli! (gerçeği) gördüğünüz halde, niçin Allah'ın âyetlerini inkâr ediyorsunuz?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے کتابیو! اللہ کی آیتوں سے کیوں کفر کرتے ہو حالانکہ تم خود گواہی ہو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Hai Ahli Kitab, mengapa kamu mengingkari ayat-ayat Allah, padahal kamu mengetahui (kebenarannya).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يَٰٓأَهْلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَٰبِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss":